    "title": "A Good Breakfast",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "Many people say that breakfast is the most important meal of the day. A good breakfast gives you energy for the morning. It also helps you to think and learn."
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "A healthy breakfast has some fruit, some bread or cereal and something to drink. For example, you can have a banana, a slice of brown bread with an egg, and a glass of milk. Try not to eat too much sugar. A chocolate bar is not a good breakfast."
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Some people say, 'I am not hungry in the morning.' This is normal, but you can start with something small. A yoghurt or a piece of fruit is enough. Drink a glass of water when you wake up, too."
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "Students who eat breakfast usually do better at school. They are less tired and they listen more carefully in class. Adults who eat breakfast often feel happier at work. So try to eat breakfast every day, even on busy mornings!"
      }
    ]
  },
